OL,3,GNEWSAPart of the A14 closed after lorry
OL,4,Ahits bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A14 has been closed in
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire following a collision
OL,8,Finvolving two lorries where one struck
OL,9,Fa bridge and caught fire.
OL,11,FNational Highways said the road had
OL,12,Fbeen closed shortly after 11:00 BST
OL,13,Feastbound between junctions seven and
OL,14,Fnine near Kettering.
OL,16,FAll emergency services including
OL,17,FNorthamptonshire Police and the air
OL,18,Fambulance service attended the
OL,19,Fincident.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
