OL,3,GNEWSAPart of the A14 closed after lorry
OL,4,Ahits bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said while the vehicle fire had been
OL,7,Fextinguished there was "significant"
OL,8,Fdamage to roadside infrastructure and
OL,9,Fthe road surface due to a large diesel
OL,10,Fspillage.
